and is distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or (at your option)
any later version. This port is a derivative work and is distributed under the same license; see
LICENSE. Every ported source file keeps the upstream copyright notices and names the file it was
ported from.

num2words-ts is not affiliated with or endorsed by the num2words authors or Savoir-faire Linux.

The upstream version this release is ported from is recorded in upstream.json and in the package
version (num2words-ts 0.5.14 is a port of num2words 0.5.14).
